                                            market intelligence, task queue, and auto-execution modules, designed to lower the barrier
                                            for users to configure and execute on-chain trading strategies with AI.</FONT></TD></TR>
<TR STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; vertical-align: top">
