<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt; text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Mr.
Shaozhang Lin, Chief Executive Officer of Youxin Technology, commented, &ldquo;We have been closely following how AI may reshape enterprise
